style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>North of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, Northwest of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, East of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnport\">Dawnport</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a> Camp, <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a> and other Tibian woods.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tSquirrels are as fast as a level 130.<br/><br/>A squirrel attacks in melee range. A squirrel will retreat at 20  (100%, full) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTry to trap them against walls or trees or, failing that, use any area attack rune, because catching one can be extremely difficult.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 8,745 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.59</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"59.142367\" style=\"text-align:center;\">59%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-tab